WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.230
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.730
Neutrino Burst. A. K.a. "The Wave".

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.940
It is a phenomenon created by an
increase in Sun spot activity...

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.380
...releasing great flares
that spread out like waves.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.620
80 years ago, when an incredibly
large Wave was released...

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.420
...or in other words, the time
of the Geduld Phenomenon...

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.890
...earth countered by strengthening its
Van-Allen belt, but in the process...

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:33.630
...lost the Southern Hemisphere and
the lives of 1.7 billion people.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.630
Ironically, the energy released into
the solar system from the Geduld...

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:40.270
...accelerated the process in which
humanity spread throughout space.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.600
At least it was written as such
in the navigator course textbook.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.160
But I couldn't have imagined
this in my wildest dreams.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:51.480
A situation that puts us smack
in the middle of the Wave.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.150
How could anyone possibly imagine...

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.250
...what would happen in the future?

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:05.080
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:12.700
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:16.700
Although loneliness...

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.040
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:28.280
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.350
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:36.320
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:43.860
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:47.640
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:51.260
...that you saw cross paths

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:54.970
Some light is shed...

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:59.550
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:06.780
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:14.790
The things I want have no shape

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:23.200
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.440
The Changing Times

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.150
What's going on?

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.190
Is this ship gonna be all right?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.500
Zwei's lousy at steering ships.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.430
Well, they're students.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.290
Huh? Why won't the door open?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:59.240
Hello! Are you asleep, Lucson?

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:03.840
<i>You'd better get up! Or your stupidity</i>
<i>will spread to the rest of your brain!</i>

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.780
How dare you!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.780
<i>Or are you shutting us out from</i>
<i>the bridge and enjoying yourself?</i>

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:08.750
<i>Your neurons have begun brawn</i>
<i>movements, so you'd better...</i>

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.470
This ship seems to be in a bit of a pickle.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.240
What's the Ryvius' present course?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.440
I demand an answer!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.420
W-We're in Geduld.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:19.930
How deep?

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:21.760
Sere Four, 170.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.060
I thought we were gonna be saved.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:30.470
Th-This is the jurisdiction of us
Zwei members. I order you to leave!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.240
Don't give me orders.

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:35.910
Perhaps you don't quite understand
our situation. We're facing a crisis.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:39.800
We know everything. Right, Charlie?

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.180
Charlie?

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:48.640
Charlie. Are you also responsible for
keeping Chic and the others locked out?

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:51.160
How could you?

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.620
I-I don't think it's good to
keep the truth from others.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.660
Everyone has the right to be
informed of the situation.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.030
At least I believe so.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.300
You were just afraid
of them, weren't you?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:07.100
You did nothing wrong, Charlie. You
did it for the good of everyone.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.270
He's powerless against these guys.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.170
Yuki...

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.570
Ascend the Ryvius.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.010
Now!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.580
Don't be ridiculous! We're
being swept by the Wave!

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.890
We haven't been able to complete
the Navigational System Solid.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.490
Hurry! Don't you wanna be rescued?

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.930
Right now, we can't be
concerned about being rescued.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:31.400
I take it that you also know about
the vessels that assaulted us.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.130
Thanks to Charlie!

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.900
Because you guys wouldn't tell us a thing!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.770
That would only cause great panic.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.060
Everyone's waiting with
high hopes for rescue.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.970
We've made every effort to do what we
believe to be the best in this situation.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.670
Please understand.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.150
Th-That's right. It's so we can all survive.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.010
What do you mean "all"?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.820
You left behind those guys
on the Liebel to die!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.850
You said they were evacuated!

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.350
W-We were in a crisis.
Besides, they're criminals.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.520
When considering our safety,
it was the obvious thing to do.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.260
H-How could you...?

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.800
You bastard! How could you be
so casual about people's lives?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.170
Don't hit me!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:09.830
Ikumi!

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:11.530
Don't stop me!

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:14.670
Okay... now.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.410
Stop it!

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:26.210
Is that an order?

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.420
You've done as you wish to this point.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.460
Now I'll do as I wish from this point on.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.460
You're free to retaliate if you wish.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:35.450
But in return...!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.470
It's still shaking a bit.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.500
Faina hasn't returned yet.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.930
I don't understand girls from Titania.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.110
E-Excuse me.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.310
I'm Akihiro from across the
hall. Is Ikumi with you?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.110
No, he's not here.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.780
He hasn't returned yet?

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:02.620
No. And neither has Kouji.
Sorry to bother you. Thank you.

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:04.190
Kouji's not around?

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.020
Maybe he's with Faina.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.690
No, that's unlikely, with
his reserved personality.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.250
That's absolutely impossible!

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.700
Jealousy, do you suppose?

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:16.830
Just the truth, I think.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:17.960
I heard that!

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.180
You guys are robot pilot candidates, right?

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:27.510
Then you'll continue with
your operation training.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:30.080
Charlie, you even told them that?

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.240
And why are you here?

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.190
I'm just here by chance.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:39.250
Not you. I'm asking the girl behind you!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.290
She's ugly.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.200
Yeah.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.700
I don't think so.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.190
Hey.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.730
What's your name?

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:46.490
Faina.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.500
U-Um, can I ask a question?

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.270
What do you plan to do after we ascend?

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.540
Why should I know?

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.770
Well, I was thinking...

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:58.610
...if we use the current of Geduld to
sweep us away, it'll allow us to escape.

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.340
We don't know where
that'll take us, you fool!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:03.080
Actually, we can figure out our course.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:04.180
Really?

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:05.190
Yes.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.650
If we put together our Navigation Solid
and successfully ride the current...

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.020
...there is a chance we can arrive
outside of Mars in a few weeks.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.890
In fact, our odds are
better taking that route!

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.320
I was thinking the same thing.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.490
You liar!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:22.030
It'll take time, but I believe
it's our safest option.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:31.670
All right. We'll consider your option.
We're not the same as Zwei, after all.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:32.980
I appreciate that.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.040
Okay, put together the Navigation Solid!

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.250
Hurry!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:37.150
R-Right!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.150
There's no way I'm gonna
cooperate with these guys.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.120
They have hostages.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.960
Very well. We'll abide by your orders.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:48.520
If there's a chance we'll survive,
we will cooperate. However...

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.490
...I insist that no violence is used.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.160
Are you the leader?

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:52.700
No.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.730
I am Lucson, the leader
and captain of this...!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.540
From now on, you take command.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:00.570
All right.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.630
And you. What is your name?

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:05.110
K-Kouji Aiba.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:09.280
Work here at the bridge. And the girl
beside you will be our caretaker.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.110
Yes.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.110
Y-Yes.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.220
<i>Come on. You could at</i>
<i>least say "thank you".</i>

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:24.430
Reduction in neutrino. Six hours
before communication device recovery.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.430
Releasing suspension
mode to main devices.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:28.900
Radiation levels dropping to D-01.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.030
All units, open shield to protection suits.

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.810
What's their condition?

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:40.080
They've been exposed
to D3 level radiation...

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.420
...with the lieutenant
exposed the least. However...

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.420
...they both have marks all over the body
to indicate they had been tortured.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.390
With the ensign, that directly...!

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:51.160
Tortured? Can I talk to the lieutenant?

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.330
I would rather not authorize it.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.760
Then will you excuse us for a moment?

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:55.520
Yes sir.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:05.170
Calculate the transfer point of the
Bratica from the Sere 4 current data.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.400
Is it being swept?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:09.140
Contact the headquarters as soon
as the lines have been recovered.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:13.180
Once we've handed over Liebel, we'll
submerge again and head after the Bratica.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:17.550
Ouch!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.250
<i>Good morning, everybody.</i>

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:22.420
I am Fu Namuchai from
Level Two Navigation.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:27.190
I'm making this announcement from
the bridge to all areas of Ryvius!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:32.300
<i>I am making this announcement</i>
<i>mainly to inform you all that Zwei...</i>

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:35.390
<i>...who have been steering this ship, have</i>
<i>hidden crucial information from us!</i>

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:41.040
<i>Having found out the truth, I
<i>felt it my duty to inform you.</i></i>

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.140
Is this really happening?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.480
<i>First of all. We are presently passing</i>
<i>through Sere Four, 360 of Geduld.</i>

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:50.680
<i>This is in order to escape</i>
<i>from an unknown enemy force.</i>

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.710
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:56.190
<i>We were under enemy attack</i>
<i>on two separate occasions!</i>

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:57.820
- <i>Yet Zwei failed to inform us of this!</i>
- We were at war?

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.550
- <i>Yet Zwei failed to inform us of this!</i>
- You're kidding.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.130
<i>We were not informed that two men...</i>

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.200
<i>...responsible for the destruction</i>
<i>of Liebe Delta were captured...</i>

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:08.500
<i>...that they were left to die, that the</i>
<i>Ryvius is equipped with a weapon...</i>

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:15.540
<i>...or that a number of students are</i>
<i>secretly trying to activate this weapon.</i>

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:18.550
<i>These are then acts by Zwei</i>
<i>members overstepping their bounds...</i>

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.880
<i>...assuming that they have special rights.</i>

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:25.650
<i>In order to return the Ryvius to</i>
<i>a safe and fair environment...</i>

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.120
<i>...my friends and</i> I...
- Is this supposed to be some kinda joke?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.090
...will be supervising Zwei.
What does he mean by enemy?

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:30.260
How should I know?

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:34.560
The members include me,
Fu Namuchai, Airs Blue...

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:37.460
...Criff Cay and Michelle Cay
from the nursing section...

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:41.590
...Son Doppo from the
technical section, Ryu Gil...

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.500
...and Kouji Aiba from the
Level Two Navigation Section.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.940
We will be sending a periodic update...

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.140
- There will be changes to your work.
- Hey.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.280
- We are currently on our way to Mars.
- Huh? Oh, sorry.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.210
He's not the son of a
swindler for nothing.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.950
We will be calling each team leader to
a meeting where we will provide details.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.720
- Until then, please remain calm...
- We look like complete criminals now.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.850
...as you proceed with regular activities.
- But he hasn't lied one bit.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.410
You traitor!

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.990
I believe that will be a name, Lucson...

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.080
...that you guys will be
known by from now on.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:08.720
Is it okay?

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.030
It can't be helped.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:13.590
No, I'm talking about your brother.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.230
I repeat. It can't be helped.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.370
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:27.780
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.270
Two scouting boats have been
destroyed. They have yet to be stopped.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:48.670
In addition, if they use their Vital
Guarder, we'd have no means to counter.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.540
Could Shimomura and his
men already be involved?

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:56.140
We're continuing our research on it, but
so far we haven't picked up on anything.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:02.580
But for them to be able to steer
the Bratica to that extent...!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.590
Is the script for the
public announcement ready?

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:06.550
In one hour.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:08.720
We must suppress them
no matter what it takes.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:13.960
But it's still too soon.
Common sense gets in the way.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.060
We must be well prepared.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.560
In the worst-case scenario,
we'll call back the "Impulse".

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.710
- What was with that announcement?
- I don't know.

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:30.610
- What did we do to deserve this?
- Those damn Zwei guys.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.810
They're probably trying
to save themselves.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:37.650
- They're the worst.
- It's meaningless to work our butts off.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:44.360
Please calm down. I believe by now you
all know, after Supervisor Fu Namchai...

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:48.350
...explained the situation
to all team leaders...

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:52.420
...that the Ryvius is currently
being swept toward Mars.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.300
The Zwei members are working around
the clock to create a Navigation Solid...

00:12:56.300 --> 00:13:01.240
...and a Solid that will allow us to land
on "Alvara", the largest city on Mars...

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.800
...from Mars' orbit.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:08.550
Furthermore, we decided at the meeting
to deploy all weapons aboard Ryvius.

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:13.310
Later, we will list the personnel needed,
so we ask for everyone's cooperation.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:18.250
Okay, send it over.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:19.420
Right.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:21.560
Here you go.

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:25.130
Thanks.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.070
You worried about Aoi and the others?

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.300
Yeah. A little.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.630
So what's gonna happen to us now?

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.400
All I wanted was to be a flight attendant.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.540
Mom and Dad are looking forward
to it. And so is Uncle John.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:45.250
They were saying at the meeting that
we'll be all right once we get to Mars.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:47.610
The worst thing you can do
now is to get depressed.

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:49.780
Lift up your head, and look ahead.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.690
We have mail from Kouji.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.090
"Due to extraordinary circumstances,
I'm working on the bridge. Bye."

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.560
Bye.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.030
Is that all?

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:01.570
That's like Kouji.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.930
You're lucky, Aoi.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:03.930
Why's that?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.030
Why is Kouji the only one
who gets to be on the bridge?

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:10.040
I have no idea why.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.800
And did you have a look at
the curriculum we received?

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.840
We have to do even more than before!

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.750
Only until we arrive at
Mars. Let's do what we can.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:22.720
How can you be so positive?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.790
Get serious!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.830
You're taking forever. Do as you're told!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:32.860
Not again.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.730
And you consider yourself
number one? Well?

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:37.930
Bastard!

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.570
Stop it!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:42.900
You're a lot more timid than I thought.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.100
Kouji and Faina are still on the bridge.

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:50.840
It's as if they've been taken hostage.
Kouji stayed for your sake, you know.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.950
Okay. So I should return the favor, right?

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:42.030
There.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.450
We should arrive at Mars in 12 days.
It's not long before we're rescued.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:15.330
We ask that until then everyone completes
their curriculum. We would appreciate it.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:18.230
Hey! You can return to your room now.

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:36.480
How's he doing?

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:41.250
He's a lot better than the average guy
out there. And so far, he's cooperating.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.720
Should he retaliate even one bit...!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:47.830
I understand. We need someone
to use as an example, right?

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:57.400
Come on. He finally returns,
and what does he do? He sleeps.

00:16:57.980 --> 00:16:59.540
I wonder how Ikumi is doing.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:00.540
I'm right here.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:03.510
Ikumi!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.410
Hey. What happened to him?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.180
He tries to be too rebellious.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:24.370
<i>Remember, there's always bound to be</i>
<i>someone out there better than you.</i>

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:25.960
<i>Understand your limits, you fool.</i>

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:34.650
He retaliates against everything he can.
He's making me tired just watching him.

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.480
I'll go to the medical room.

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:47.690
U-Um, long time no see. We
keep missing each other.

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:49.930
Were you lonely?

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.990
You've fallen asleep?

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:56.540
They haven't allowed us to even
take a shower for three days.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.370
They need a lesson on
how to treat women!

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:01.330
So what do you plan to do?

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:05.000
It's best to make the
Navigation Solid first.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.810
Y-You mean there's still something else?

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.120
Just in case there's something else.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:14.180
I believe that help
will come. I believe it.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:31.330
Yuki!

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:34.270
Why? What's he doing here?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:37.570
Not again.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:46.980
What are you looking at?

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:52.850
Your unforgiving expression.

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:58.000
I'm not like you, brother, always doing
as others wish. I act on my own will.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.590
And get beaten up as a result.
That's just plain stupid.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.270
Something that you could never copy!

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:06.740
Not someone who has what he wants taken
away, and continues to wear a smile!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.050
Asking for a fight?

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.380
Kouji, are you awake?

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.220
We'd better return to the bridge.

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.290
Yes. Right away.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.730
What is it with that girl?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.130
It has nothing to do with you.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:36.100
Let's go.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.960
Damn you. What about Aoi?

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.180
Wake up, everyone! The
current level has increased!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.580
What did you say?

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.710
Something's coming from afar.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.050
Something? What?

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:02.320
Something large!

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.530
That doesn't tell us anything!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.260
You can analyze it with F345.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:07.290
Gotcha.

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:10.590
Hey, guy. That seat now belongs to Blue.

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:15.800
Can I ask you something?

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.340
Sure.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.800
What do you do to forget
something you wanna forget?

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.850
It's impossible to forget.

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:25.340
I see.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:29.080
"You can only part with
your past, on your own."

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.160
Words of the Holy Mother Arne.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.180
She's my home planet's god of Protection.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.390
Part with my past.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.120
Everyone carries the same feeling.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:41.920
You too?

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:43.760
Of course.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:50.070
We're in Sere Four. Not even the Orbital
Security Bureau can come this far.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.640
What did you find?

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.310
L-It's shaped like a squid!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.240
You're nuts!

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.920
But it really is a squid!

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:07.030
Snap out of it! Erase that data at once. If
Fu finds out, I won't hear the end of it!

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:21.860
Neya.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:29.210
Watch out!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:30.550
What is it?

00:21:30.550 --> 00:21:31.780
I told you, the squid...!

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:13.850
In your dry eyes...

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:18.920
...a silhouette appears

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:23.620
The blue colored future...

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:29.720
...swayed and glittered

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:39.770
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:48.380
...freedom out of pity

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:56.820
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:56.820 --> 00:23:00.730
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:23:00.730 --> 00:23:07.100
goodbye

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:12.620
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.290
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:18.400
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
As we got past Geduld and
arrived in the vicinity of Mars...

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:20.670
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
...we were greeted
by a fleet of ships from Mars.

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:23.270
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
We had no idea whether
they were an ally or enemy.

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:25.940
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
We had no idea what
waited for us in the future...

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:28.210
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
...or this moment, for that matter.

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.170
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
We didn't know anything.

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:30.900
Next episode: We Didn't Know Anything
